Description: Command-line tool for Google Cloud Storage
 gsutil is a Python application that lets you access Google Cloud Storage from
 the command line. It allows users to perform various operations such as
 uploading and downloading files, managing buckets, and configuring ACLs. The
 tool supports parallel data transfer, resumable uploads, and integrates well
 with Google Cloud authentication and project management tools.
